      "value": "Eldrin Altar"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Altar",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " will allow me to create some of the most powerful magical artifacts, those hinted at only by legend in ages to come. First, I will need to make the altar itself, and surround it just so with pedestals.\n\nNext, I will need to create "
        },
        {
          "text": " Eldrin Conduits",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " and place them somewhere within 7 blocks of the altar, and somewhere their top crystal will have a clear line of sight to the altar. Not all recipes need all types of power, so I only need to place the ones that the recipe actually requires.  "
        },
        {
          "text": "The lesser conduits do not supply power well enough to work with the Eldrin Altar",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nWhen I have everything ready, I must place the required items on the altar and surrounding pedestals (I'm pretty sure order or position doesn't matter as long as "
        },
        {
          "text": "at least one item is on the Altar itself",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "), and activate the altar with an empty hand. Then all that's left is to enjoy the show."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
